.TH tkumd n 0.1 tkutils
.SH tkutils::tkumd
.PP
Markdown outline viewer. Built on \fBtclutils::tumd\fR; the document headings are shown as a nested outline in a ttk::treeview.
.SS API
.CS
set w [::tkutils::tkumd::widget .w ?-height N?]
::tkutils::tkumd::setMarkdown  $w markdownText
::tkutils::tkumd::loadFile     $w path
::tkutils::tkumd::getHeadings  $w               ;# list of {level title}
.CE
.SS Launcher
.CS
tclsh bin/tkumd.tcl document.md
.CE
